      "body": "Scope clarification from the independent #4624 review: the durable-root fix must also make the session durable Coder profile authoritative during reconciliation and recovery. Reconciliation must use the session-planned owner, template ID, parameters, and persistent root rather than silently using current singleton deployment config. FindBySession/adoption must reject workspace owner/name/template mismatches before any session-scoped worker credential is uploaded. This is part of the same persistence/template contract and is a merge blocker for #4624.",
